---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import CodeTabs from "../components/CodeTabs.astro";
import LiveDemo from "../components/LiveDemo.astro";
import { FRONT_DOOR_DEMO } from "../data/demo";
import Availability from "../components/Availability.astro";
import QuickstartPicker from "../components/QuickstartPicker.astro";
import Stuck from "../components/Stuck.astro";
import { hubMeta } from "../config/hubs";
import { API_SECRET_URL, SECTIONS } from "../config/nav";

const meta = hubMeta("start");
---

<Base title="Quickstart — bitHuman docs" description={meta.description}>
  <section class="s-hero" data-pagefind-filter={`section:${SECTIONS.overview.label}`}>
    <div class="container">
      <a class="crumb" href="/" data-pagefind-ignore>‹ Docs</a>
      <h1>Quickstart</h1>
      <p class="lede" data-subtitle>Talk to a live avatar, get an API secret, then run your own.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="s-block">
    <div class="container s-demo">
      <div>
        <h2 id="talk-to-an-avatar"><span class="step">1</span> Talk to an avatar</h2>
        <p>Pick a model and start a live conversation in this page: no install and no account.</p>
        <LiveDemo models={FRONT_DOOR_DEMO} eager label="Talk to a live avatar" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 id="api-secret"><span class="step">2</span> Get your API secret</h2>
        <p>Sign up at bithuman.ai and choose the Creator plan or higher (<a href="/pricing#plans">plans</a>): from 2026-10-12 a Free account's API secret is refused. Then create an API secret and export it. The live demo and the web embed need neither, and the CLI can sign in with <code>bithuman login</code> instead.</p>
        <div class="chip-row"><Availability plan="creator" /></div>
        <CodeTabs tabs={[{ label: "Shell", lang: "bash", code: `export BITHUMAN_API_SECRET="<your API secret>"` }]} />
        <p class="s-small"><a href={API_SECRET_URL}>Create an API secret ↗</a> · <a href="/start/api-secret">How the API secret works</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="s-block alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="choose-your-platform"><span class="step">3</span> Pick your platform</h2>
      <p class="s-intro">What are you building? The Website, Terminal, Python and REST steps run as pasted after you export your API secret. The app platforms show the core calls; their page has the complete first run. New to the words? <a href="/models/how-it-works#key-terms">Key terms</a>.</p>
      <QuickstartPicker />
      <Stuck />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="s-block s-last">
    <div class="container s-more">
      <p class="s-small"><a href="/models#choosing-a-model">Which model?</a> · <a href="/pricing">Pricing: credits pay for active session time, talking or idle</a> · <a href="/platforms">All platforms</a> · <a href="/examples">Example gallery</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .s-hero { padding-block: var(--s-8) var(--s-6); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  /* No desktop breadcrumbs (docs v2); a phone gets "‹ Docs". */
  .crumb { display: none; font-size: var(--ft-sm); color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--s-3); }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .crumb { display: inline-block; } }
  .s-hero h1 { font-size: var(--fs-h1); line-height: var(--lh-h1); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .s-hero .lede { margin-top: var(--s-3); font-size: var(--ft-lg); color: var(--color-text-secondary); max-width: 62ch; }
  .s-block { padding-block: var(--s-10); }
  .s-block.alt { background: var(--color-surface-2); border-block: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .s-block h2 { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--s-3); font-size: var(--fh-lg); margin-bottom: var(--s-3); }
  .step { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-primary-soft); color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--ft-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-medium); }
  .s-demo { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--s-12); align-items: start; }
  .s-demo p { margin-block: var(--s-3); }
  .s-demo :global(.ld) { margin: var(--s-4) 0 0; }
  .s-intro { max-width: 70ch; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .s-small { margin-top: var(--s-3); font-size: var(--ft-sm); }
  .s-last { padding-block: var(--s-8); }
  .s-claim { margin: 0; font-size: var(--ft-lg); font-weight: var(--fw-medium); color: var(--color-text); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .s-demo { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-8); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .s-block { padding-block: var(--s-8); } }
</style>
